     1	"""Search on a store being written (docs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/live-service/OPERATING-CONTRACT.md, row 4a; proofs 8a to 8c):
     2	the lexical ranking counts only views visible at the request's bound; the index embeds only views visible at the last completed day;
     3	a vector is used only for a visible view whose text and model match; a newly visible view is served from a matching cached vector or
     4	lexically; a service started on a first-day store builds no index; a build committing during a search changes nothing in it. Real
     5	stores in WAL mode on temporary paths; embeddings from a deterministic fake; no network."""
